#   pyramiding 0
#   exits begin signal_index +1
#   exact exit-candle signal allowed
#   same-bar tie:
#       open->high closer => target first
#       otherwise stop first
#
# Compounding:
#   starting balance £100
#   1% of realised balance at ENTRY
#   overlapping trades keep their entry risk amount
#   EXIT before ENTRY at equal timestamp
# ============================================================


